 or one-time."},{"text":"Review headcount and payroll costs."},{"text":"Analyse procurement expenses."},{"text":"Update the full-year forecast."},{"text":"Estimate the likely year-end variance."},{"text":"Recommend corrective actions."},{"text":"Present the revised forecast to management."},{"text":"Continue monitoring the department."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply to report “budget exceeded”, but to explain why, what happens next and what management can do."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Budget Analysts can work in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"Public-sector enterprises"},{"text":"Municipal organisations"},{"text":"Public universities"},{"text":"Government hospitals"},{"text":"Public financial institutions"},{"text":"Planning departments"},{"text":"Government finance departments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Budget Officer"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Finance Officer"},{"text":"Planning & Budgeting Analyst"},{"text":"Accounts/Finance Officer"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility and recruitment processes vary by organisation and post."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Qualification","Relevance"],"rows":[[{"text":"CMA"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Com Management Accounting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Com Finance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Financial Analytics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Finance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"CIMA"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Routes"},{"type":"h","text":"FP&A Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Cost & Management Accounting","Budget Analyst","FP&A Analyst","Senior FP&A Analyst","FP&A Manager"]},{"t